flowchart TB
accTitle: Edge delivery and cross-AZ application availability complement each other
accDescr: CloudFront with WAF sends static cache misses to private S3 and dynamic requests to an ALB-backed multi-AZ web fleet. The web fleet uses an RDS primary with a synchronous standby in another AZ.
U[Global HTTPS requests]:::inputData --> C[CloudFront and WAF<br/>Cache and inspect requests]:::process
C -->|Static cache miss, OAC| S[(Private S3 assets)]:::storage
C -->|Dynamic paths| L[ALB]:::process
L --> W[EC2 Auto Scaling web tier<br/>AZ A and AZ B]:::process
W --> P[(RDS MySQL primary<br/>AZ A)]:::storage
P -->|Synchronous replication| B[(RDS standby<br/>AZ B)]:::storage
